{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/StorePage_Category_01_english.png?t=1744960998\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/timeactionroguelike-optimize.gif?t=1744960998\" />Ascend to ZERO is a time action roguelike that uses time freeze to wipe out enemies. Use your unique time freeze ability to save a world on the brink of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/StorePage_Category_02_english.png?t=1744960998\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/timestop-optimize.gif?t=1744960998\" />When you stop time, dodging attacks or evading enemies is entirely up to you. Anticipate, freeze, counterattack, and experience dynamic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/StorePage_Category_04_english.png?t=1744960998\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/growth-optimize.gif?t=1744960998\" />Grow infinitely stronger by replaying the game. Level up in an instant and feel the thrill of overcoming your limits as you acquire powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/StorePage_Category_03_english.png?t=1744960998\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/characters-optimize.gif?t=1744960998\" />Realize the future that could have been yours and be reborn as a new avatar. Discover your own playstyle through unique skills and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey to correct past mistakes and build a new future begins now.\u00a0Are you ready to save the world in just 30 seconds?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2697940?t=1744960998","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2697940?t=1744960998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/2e6e41235b750393122b03c8e3a1d670b833ce11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744960998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/2e6e41235b750393122b03c8e3a1d670b833ce11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744960998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3279910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/StorePage_Category_01_english.png?t=1744960998\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/timeactionroguelike-optimize.gif?t=1744960998\" />Ascend to ZERO is a time action roguelike that uses time freeze to wipe out enemies. Use your unique time freeze ability to save a world on the brink of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a